  m_text: "<color=#FF4343>Hold</color> Alt Fire to rev <color=#FF4343>chainsaw</color>.\n\n<color=#FF4343>Release</color> to launch, <color=#FF4343>piercing</color> enemies and <color=#FF4343>returning</color> back.\n\nCan be <color=#FF4343>punched</color> to keep active."
