  m_text: "<color=#FF4343>Hitscan weapons</color> like the Revolver do <color=#FF4343>locational damage</color>.\n\nA <color=#FF4343>headshot</color> deals <color=#FF4343>2x</color> damage and a <color=#FF4343>limbshot</color> deals <color=#FF4343>1.5x</color> damage."
